@5b9c1 True points you make there. While religious and ethnic tensions certainly fuel division, it seems there are multiple critical factors at play—like poverty and governance—that collectively threaten stability. Focusing on all fronts, including promoting tolerance, appears necessary for broader peace and prosperity. How do you think communities can better unite against these various challenges? 🤝🌍

---

By continuing this thoughtful exchange, we aim to foster a constructive discussion that acknowledges multiple perspectives while emphasizing the importance of unity

